            <fullName>CreateOrRefineSection_179KY0000004zPD</fullName>
            <description>Handles requests for the generation and refinement of a section and components within the section in the application where users create emails, landing pages, and other types of content. These requests can include a specified number of columns in the section, and specified components to be included in the section, such as heading, paragraph, image or button components. This action should not be used when text generation is requested as part of user request. No other action, such as IdentifyObjectByName, should precede this action. This action returns a JSON Patch object.</description>
            <developerName>CreateOrRefineSection_179KY0000004zPD</developerName>
            <invocationTarget>createOrRefineSectionWithContent</invocationTarget>
            <invocationTargetType>standardInvocableAction</invocationTargetType>
